---
---

<section class="fullwidth-section legal-section-clean" id="legal">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="legal-header-clean">
      <span class="legal-tag-clean red-text">LEGAL VERIFICATION & CREDENTIALS</span>
      <h2 class="legal-title-clean">
        Officially Registered Corporate Entity <span class="red-text">in Indonesia</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="legal-intro-clean">
        The business legality of <strong>PT CHAIN ASIA CONECT</strong> is officially registered as an Individual Limited Liability Company (PT Perorangan) as of <strong>September 1, 2026</strong> under the Ministry of Law and Human Rights (Kemenkumham RI) and Online Single Submission (OSS BKPM).
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Official Authority Logos Placement (Kemenkumham RI & OSS BKPM) -->
    <div class="legal-logos-row">
      <div class="authority-logo-item">
        <span class="authority-label">Republic of Indonesia Ministry Authority:</span>
        <div class="logo-slot-clean">
          <img src="/images/kememnkeu-logo.png" alt="Kemenkumham RI Official Emblem" class="authority-logo-img" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="authority-logo-item">
        <span class="authority-label">National Business Portal (OSS BKPM):</span>
        <div class="logo-slot-clean">
          <img src="/images/logo-oss-pemerintah.png" alt="OSS BKPM Official Institution Logo" class="authority-logo-img" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Credentials Stack (Clean Rows, No Card Boxes, No inner lines) -->
    <div class="legal-credentials-clean">
      <div class="cred-clean-row">
        <span class="cred-clean-label">SK KEMENKUMHAM RI DECREE</span>
        <div class="cred-clean-body">
          <strong class="cred-clean-val red-text">AHU-A117353.AH.01.30.Year 2026</strong>
          <span class="cred-clean-desc">Officially decreed by the Ministry of Law and Human Rights of the Republic of Indonesia on August 29, 2026.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cred-clean-row">
        <span class="cred-clean-label">BUSINESS IDENTIFICATION NO. (NIB)</span>
        <div class="cred-clean-body">
          <strong class="cred-clean-val red-text">0709260109599</strong>
          <span class="cred-clean-desc">KBLI 62193 (Blockchain Technology Application Development & Supply Chain Systems).</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cred-clean-row">
        <span class="cred-clean-label">TAX IDENTIFICATION NO. (NPWP)</span>
        <div class="cred-clean-body">
          <strong class="cred-clean-val red-text">10.000.000.1-094.6336</strong>
          <span class="cred-clean-desc">Officially registered with the Directorate General of Taxes of the Republic of Indonesia.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cred-clean-row">
        <span class="cred-clean-label">CORPORATE LEGAL STATUS</span>
        <div class="cred-clean-body">
          <strong class="cred-clean-val" style="color: #16a34a;">OFFICIALLY VERIFIED & ACTIVE</strong>
          <span class="cred-clean-desc">Registered Individual Limited Liability Company in the Republic of Indonesia.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .legal-section-clean {
    background: #ffffff;
    padding: 3.5rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  }

  .legal-header-clean {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .legal-tag-clean {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .legal-title-clean {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.8vw, 2.7rem);
    color: var(--text-dark);
  }

  .legal-intro-clean {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-body);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  /* Official Authority Logos Row */
  .legal-logos-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .authority-logo-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }

  .authority-label {
    font-size: 0.775rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .logo-slot-clean {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .authority-logo-img {
    height: 48px;
    width: auto;
    max-width: 180px;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .logo-placeholder-text {
    display: none;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
    border: 1px dashed var(--border-light);
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: #f8fafc;
  }

  .legal-credentials-clean {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.15rem;
  }

  .cred-clean-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0;
  }

  .cred-clean-label {
    width: 240px;
    font-size: 0.775rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .cred-clean-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.15rem;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .cred-clean-val {
    font-family: monospace;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .cred-clean-desc {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-body);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .cred-clean-row {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.25rem;
    }
    .cred-clean-label {
      width: 100%;
    }
    .legal-logos-row {
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
